            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The transesophageal echocardiography of a 56-year-old woman admitted with anterior myocardial infarction and stroke showed extensive thrombosis in a biological prosthetic aortic root; the patient had discontinued oral anticoagulants three months before.</AbstractText>
